 scen_h="An illustrative STR financing question",
 scen=["An operator with a cabin grossing $68,000 in bookings last year wants to refinance. The program review will not start from $68,000: it will ask what documentation supports the figure, what the property's legal STR status is, what the market rent would be as a long-term rental, and which of those numbers the program's rules count. Illustrative example, not a customer.",
      "The forecast that survives that review is the one worth financing against."],
 fit_h="STR income against long-term treatment",
