 scen=["An investor closed a $200,000 cash purchase two months ago, spent $20,000 on improvements, and wants capital back for the next deal. Whether the file runs under delayed-financing-style treatment or waits for standard cash-out seasoning, and whether valuation uses cost or current appraisal, are rules questions with materially different answers. Illustrative example, not a customer.",
      "Both paths exist in the market; which applies is a program fact, not a preference."],
